# Paid LLM calls

Do not run `python -m agent investigate` without `--provider rules`, and do not call Anthropic or OpenAI APIs, unless the user explicitly asks in that turn.

`--provider rules`, simulator, ingest, and Postgres queries are fine. Embeddings must stay local/free unless the user opts into a paid API.
